'''Professor Robot''' is an [[NPC]] located in the {{zone|Lost Precursor City}}. He grants the player access to the {{Item|Sapphire Crystal}}.

== Quest ==
In order to obtain the {{Item|Sapphire Crystal}}, '''Professor Robot''' must be given the following items:
*{{Item|Electron Transmitter}}
*{{Item|FTX 3070}}
*{{Item|Robotron Reflector}}
*{{Item|Superlite Motor}}
*{{Item|Control Switch}}
*{{Item|Synthetic Heart}}

Or
*{{Item|Precursor Apparatus}}

They cost a total of {{BZC|*1 Electron Transmitter *1 FTX 3070 *1 Robotron Reflector *1 Superlite Motor *1 Control Switch *1 Synthetic Heart}} or {{BZC|*1 Precursor Apparatus}} respectively.

